---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import GlassButton from '../components/GlassButton.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Anisha — Astro by Anisha"
  description="Discover Anisha Banerji's journey, lineage, and practice. A contemporary, grounded approach to Vedic astrology and contemplative tarot."
  currentPath="/about"
>
  <!-- Header: Spacious & Editorial -->
  <section class="pt-12 pb-10 sm:pt-16 sm:pb-14 md:pt-20 md:pb-16 lg:pt-24 lg:pb-20 bg-[#fcfbf9] border-b border-[#28231e]/10">
    <div class="max-w-4xl xl:max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8 text-center">
      <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#a37a4c] font-semibold block mb-3">
        Personal Profile
      </span>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl text-[#1c1917] tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Anisha Banerji
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl text-[#57534e] font-light max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed italic">
        "Astrology is not an evasion of responsibility; it is an intimate conversation with the timing of your life."
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Editorial Biography: High Presence Photograph & Breathing Room -->
  <section class="py-14 sm:py-18 md:py-20 lg:py-24 xl:py-28 bg-[#faf8f5]">
    <div class="max-w-5xl xl:max-w-6xl 2xl:max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8 lg:px-12 xl:px-16">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 md:gap-10 lg:gap-16 xl:gap-20 items-start">
        
        <!-- Sticky Left Portrait Column -->
        <div class="md:col-span-5 lg:col-span-5 xl:col-span-5 md:sticky md:top-28">
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-[#28231e]/10 shadow-2xl bg-white aspect-[4/5] max-w-sm md:max-w-none mx-auto">
            <img
              src="/images/anisha.webp"
              alt="Anisha Banerji"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top"
              loading="eager"
            />
          </div>

          <div class="mt-6 p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-lg bg-white border border-[#28231e]/10 text-xs text-[#57534e] space-y-3 max-w-sm md:max-w-none mx-auto">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
              <span class="text-[#857f77] uppercase tracking-wider text-[10px]">Tradition</span>
              <span class="font-semibold text-[#1c1917]">Parashari Jyotish</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
              <span class="text-[#857f77] uppercase tracking-wider text-[10px]">Disciplines</span>
              <span class="font-semibold text-[#1c1917]">Vedic Astrology &bull; Tarot</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
              <span class="text-[#857f77] uppercase tracking-wider text-[10px]">Consultations</span>
              <span class="font-semibold text-[#1c1917]">Private Video Worldwide</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Narrative Column with Generous Whitespace -->
        <div class="md:col-span-7 lg:col-span-7 xl:col-span-7 space-y-8 sm:space-y-10 text-sm sm:text-base text-[#57534e] font-light leading-relaxed">
          
          <div>
            <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-[#1c1917] mb-5 tracking-tight">
              A Refined Approach to Sacred Timing
            </h2>
            <p>
              Growing up between India and the United Kingdom, I witnessed two polarized extremes in the esoteric arts. In one, ancient Vedic astrology was treated with cultural reverence but often entangled in fatalism, superstition, and anxiety-inducing prophecies. In the other, commercial western culture reduced celestial mapping into casual twelve-sign memes.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4">
              I founded Astro by Anisha to offer a grounded alternative: a practice that honors the rigorous mathematics of the Lahiri ephemeris while holding a dignified, compassionate space for personal agency and psychological nuance.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-8 rounded-lg bg-white border border-[#28231e]/10 shadow-xs space-y-4">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-[#1c1917] tracking-tight">Guiding Principles</h3>
            <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-[#57534e]">
              <p>
                <strong class="text-[#1c1917] font-semibold">Self-Sovereignty:</strong> Planets indicate seasons and energetic currents; they do not dictate your character or negate your free will.
              </p>
              <p>
                <strong class="text-[#1c1917] font-semibold">Astronomical Rigor:</strong> Every calculation is computed from exact planetary ephemeris, whether in sidereal Parashari coordinates or western tropical placements.
              </p>
              <p>
                <strong class="text-[#1c1917] font-semibold">Collaborative Dialogue:</strong> Consultations are not passive readings—they are intelligent conversations centered on your real-world decisions and timing.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-[#1c1917] mb-5 tracking-tight">
              The Consultation Space
            </h2>
            <p>
              Before we meet for your session, I spend focused time calculating and analyzing your planetary charts, active Vimshottari Dashas, and transit thresholds.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4">
              During our time together, you are invited to bring your most important questions regarding career crossroads, relational timing, creative transitions, or personal recalibration. You will leave with grounded timelines, actionable perspective, and a renewed sense of clarity.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-6 border-t border-[#28231e]/10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-4">
            <GlassButton
              text="Book a Consultation"
              href="/consultations"
              size="medium"
            />
            <a
              href="/articles"
              class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#a37a4c] hover:underline px-4 py-2"
            >
              Read Articles & Essays &rarr;
            </a>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
